Crosswinds

    In crosswinds, disc wheels dramatically outperform spoked wheels, since the drag
coef辌ients for disc wheels decreases sharply as the yaw angle increases. As
yaw angle increases to around 20, drag coef辌ients for disc wheels drop dra-
